  "details": "The debug menus accessible with the \"--enable-debug-gui\" launch option cause massive framerate drops in specific situations.\n\nThe [Right Shift + ` + 1] menu decreases framerate from 240 to ~80 in my case if done soon after launching the game. If the game runs for hours, the framerate could go down to 1 fps and lower, making it not even possible to close this menu.\n\nThe [Right Shift + ` + 2] menu decreases framerate to ~25 while downloading a world.",
